<title>UK: One twin gets in free for Comedy of Errors.</title>
<headline>One twin gets in free for Comedy of Errors.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Identical twins can claim two tickets for the price of one at a new production of &quot;The Comedy of Errors,&quot; Shakespeare's classic play about the mayhem caused by mistaken identities.</p>
<p>Identical twins have to present themselves together at the box office of the Young Vic theatre to get the special deal from the Royal Shakespeare Company, the producers said on Wednesday.</p>
